    "pros": [
      "Keeps pavers close to their unsealed appearance",
      "Adds stain resistance without visible shine",
      "Designed for interlocking pavers and their joints",
      "Low odor and simple cleanup",
      "Part of a full line of paver prep products"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Little or no color revival on faded pavers",
      "Water-based film still needs a good weather window",
