      "Contractor brand sold through hardscape suppliers",
      "Good fit for older patios with ordinary joint sand"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Needs bone-dry joints to stabilize properly",
      "Uses a lot of product when flooding joints",
      "Harder to find at big-box stores"
